<title>FINLAND: KONEVUOKRAAMO SAYS PANOSTAJA HAS 9.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>KONEVUOKRAAMO SAYS PANOSTAJA HAS 9.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction machinery leasing company Rakentajain Konevuokraamo Oy said on Tuesday that Panostaja Oy's holding of its share capital had fallen to below 10 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Panostaja Oy still holds 328,482 B-shares ... which corresponds to 9.70 percent of shares and 2.29 percent of votes,&quot; Konevuokraamo said in a statement.  </p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
